  Cell["f* = (ev_Y \[CircleTimes] id_{X*})(id_{Y*} \[CircleTimes] f \
\[CircleTimes] id_{X*})(id_{Y*} \[CircleTimes] coev_X) = (id_{X*} \
\[CircleTimes] \:1ebdv_Y)(id_{X*} \[CircleTimes] f \[CircleTimes] \
id_{Y*})(c\:0303oev_X \[CircleTimes] id_{Y*}). The equality of these two \
expressions is condition (i) of \[Section]1.7.1: it is what makes the \
category pivotal.", "Text", ExpressionUUID -> 
    "4d53782e-f8ea-4e70-825f-930b48284861"], 
